abstract: >-
  KampoBench is a benchmark for evaluating Large Language Models (LLMs) 
  on Japanese Kampo (traditional) medicine scenarios. Built on OpenAI's 
  HealthBench framework, it provides a comprehensive evaluation suite for 
  assessing LLM performance in traditional Japanese medical contexts.
  
  The dataset (74 scenarios, 310 rubric criteria) was drafted by a large language
  model and then reviewed and revised by multiple board-certified Kampo physicians.
  It is distributed separately under CC BY 4.0; this repository contains the
  evaluation code. See DATA_LICENSE.md and jsonl/kampobench_provenance.md.
